DO NOT DELETE THESE FILES

While Turbo C++ 3.0 and Borland C++ 5.0 have no trouble compiling and linking
the UUCP projects, we ran into linker errors with Borland C++ 3.1.   The
solution to which is to compile some of Borland's "C Runtime Library Source
Code" directly and link those objects into the executable.

To avoid recompiling those same modules yourself, we have compiled them and
placed just the .OBJ files in this directory.  If you remove these files then
you will be unable to compile using BC 3.1.
